# Build context for infra/docker/Dockerfile.desk, which needs BOTH trees (the desk's app plus the
# three Baskfy packages). Allow-list, not deny-list: this directory holds `.env.staging`,
# `kite-momentum-rebalancer/.env`, `kite-momentum-rebalancer/data/portfolio.db` and the regression
# corpus, none of which may enter an image layer. Everything is excluded unless named below.
#
# `docker build decile-blueprint` (Dockerfile.python / Dockerfile.web) reads decile-blueprint's
# own .dockerignore, not this one.
*
!decile-blueprint/packages/core
!decile-blueprint/packages/execution
!decile-blueprint/packages/providers
!kite-momentum-rebalancer/app
!kite-momentum-rebalancer/config
!kite-momentum-rebalancer/scripts
!kite-momentum-rebalancer/requirements.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/tests
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.db
